{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S03、S11等较短段落中，感受描述切分得过密，连续出现的提示可能让观众来不及消化，也容易分散听音乐的注意力；Y的完整句子在交代人物动机和前后因果时更自然。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮关键词把每段叙事的核心抓手直接交给观众，话语与感受交替出现，加上感受按音乐段落适时出现，扫屏时更容易抓住重点，也更容易注意到旋律、节奏、音色和身体感受的细微变化。Y的完整叙述更有利于理解人物为什么犹豫、为什么反复，以及最终如何作出选择，整体故事的因果衔接也更顺畅。但X的感受描写更贴近音乐的具体变化，情绪不只是笼统的悲伤、愤怒或喜悦，而有起伏、转折和身体层面的细节，因此综合来看我选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "766ad08f-2914-48d9-8e46-ece8e17ed33b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T193901971874Z", "elapsed_seconds": 104.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:40:46.694296+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "06ecb65de374ae500cc0420b104cad5e90fd2ea510aa5bdeb8e4de28f1fd2f97", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33c